00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:22.334
Who wants me
to pick their number?

00:08:22.334 --> 00:08:23.801
It's a good sweater.

00:08:23.801 --> 00:08:25.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:27.601 --> 00:08:29.968
442!

00:08:29.968 --> 00:08:31.968
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:08:40.367 --> 00:08:42.367
Hi!

00:08:42.367 --> 00:08:43.968
How you doing?
-Good. How are you?

00:08:43.968 --> 00:08:45.100
-I'm fantastic.

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.300
What is your name
and where are you from?

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.501
-Maria from Colombia.
-Maria from Colombia!

00:08:49.501 --> 00:08:52.167
Oh, my goodness.

00:08:52.167 --> 00:08:53.801
Maria, you have
a beautiful sweater on.

00:08:53.801 --> 00:08:56.501
Does it get
a little chilly in Colombia?

00:08:56.501 --> 00:08:57.901
-Um, no.
-No.

00:08:57.901 --> 00:09:00.400
So this is perfect,
because those rare occasions

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:03.000
when it does become chilly,
you're going to have something.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.901
Do you have anything like this?
-No.

00:09:04.901 --> 00:09:07.167
-No. Would you like to
try it on?

00:09:07.167 --> 00:09:08.434
-Of course.
-Oh, my God.

00:09:08.434 --> 00:09:10.000
Guys, give it up for
Maria from Colombia.

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:16.167 --> 00:09:20.167
You got your gla-- Oh.

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:21.367
-Thank you.
-No pr--

00:09:21.367 --> 00:09:24.834
Oh, Maria, this is --
I mean, this is gor--

00:09:24.834 --> 00:09:27.033
Look at this. That's gorgeous.

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:29.367
Oh, you're a model.
Thank you so much.

00:09:29.367 --> 00:09:32.033
Give it up for Maria, everybody.
Thanks again.

00:09:32.033 --> 00:09:35.467
Stick around. We'll be
